.* QUIWRKDEVD: WRKDEVD, the device descriptions with their options.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=HINTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 19'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=POSTO CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=POSHINT CLASS=HINTCL VALUE='Starting characters'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=DEVD CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=DEVS VARS='OPT DEVD DEVTYPE DEVTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Create
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='RETURN 14'.F14=Work with status
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKDEVD KEYL=KEYS HELP=WRKDEVDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Device Descriptions
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=22.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=POSTO USAGE=INPUT HELP='FLD/POSTO'.Position to
:DATAIX VAR=POSHINT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=DEVS SCROLL=YES.(No device descriptions)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.)' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD ?CRTDEVDSP' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.)' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.)' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD DSPDEVD DEVD(&DEVD.) OUTPUT(*PRINT)' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.6=Print
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='CMD ?RNMOBJ OBJ(QSYS/&DEVD.) OBJTYPE(*DEVD)' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.7=Rename
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKCFGSTS CFGTYPE(*DEV) CFGD(&DEVD.)' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.8=Work with status
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109' HELP='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.9=Retrieve source
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKDEVD/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DEVD'.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DEVTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DEVTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKDEVDH.Work with Device Descriptions - Help
:P.The device descriptions in name order, with their type and text.
Type an option next to a device to change, copy, delete, display,
print or rename its description, see its status or get the command
that would create it. Type a name in Position to and press Enter to
start the list there.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 shows the list again, F6 creates a description, F14 shows the
status of every device, F9 brings back the last command, F3 and F12
leave.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/POSTO'.Position to
:P.Type the position to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKDEVD/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DEVD'.Device
:P.The device the data goes to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DEVTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DEVTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKDEVD/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it. The Change
Device Description (CHGDEVD) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.3=Copy
:PD.Type 3 next to an entry and press Enter to copy it. The Create
Device Desc (Display) (CRTDEVDSP) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.4=Delete
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to delete it. The Delete
Device Description (DLTDEVD) command runs for the entry.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it. The Display
Device Description (DSPDEVD) command runs for the entry.
:PT.6=Print
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to print it. The Display
Device Description (DSPDEVD) command runs for the entry.
:PT.7=Rename
:PD.Type 7 next to an entry and press Enter to rename it. The Rename
Object (RNMOBJ) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.8=Work with status
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to work with status it. The
Work with Configuration Status (WRKCFGSTS) command runs for the entry.
:PT.9=Retrieve source
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to retrieve source it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
